# language: en

Feature: Signal API Inspect

  Scenario Outline: HeadlessApp_Inspect_Signal
        Given PAL set a signal <path> to <datatype> <value>
        Then HeadlessApp can inspect the signal <path> of <datatype>


Examples:
    | path                                                     | datatype  | value     |
    | Vehicle.Acceleration | complex | {"Longitudinal":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Lateral":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Vertical":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} |
    | Vehicle.AngularVelocity | complex | {"Roll":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Pitch":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Yaw":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} |
    | Vehicle.AverageSpeed | float | 0.0 |
    | Vehicle.CargoVolume | float | 1.70141175e+38 |
    | Vehicle.CurbWeight | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.CurrentOverallWeight | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.EmissionsCO2 | int16 | 0 |
    | Vehicle.GrossWeight | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.Height | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.IsAutoPowerOptimize | bool | false |
    | Vehicle.IsBrokenDown | bool | false |
    | Vehicle.IsMoving | bool | false |
    | Vehicle.Length | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.LowVoltageSystemState | string | LOCK |
    | Vehicle.MaxTowBallWeight | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.MaxTowWeight | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.PowerOptimizeLevel | uint8 | 5 |
    | Vehicle.RoofLoad | int16 | 0 |
    | Vehicle.Speed | float | 0.0 |
    | Vehicle.StartTime | string | THIS_IS_B_TEST_STRING |
    | Vehicle.TraveledDistance | uint32 | 2147483647 |
    | Vehicle.TraveledDistanceSinceStart | uint32 | 2147483647 |
    | Vehicle.TripDuration | float | 0.0 |
    | Vehicle.TurningDiameter | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.WidthExcludingMirrors | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.WidthFoldedMirrors | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.WidthIncludingMirrors | uint16 | 32767 |
    

